<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19024" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fūmōsus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>full of smoke</i>, <i>smoking</i>, <i>smoky</i>, <i>smoked</i> (class.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ligna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 130</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flamma,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 38, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fax,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 97</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">December (because many fires are then made),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					5, 30, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">paries,</span>”
				<i>well smoked</i>, <i>smoky</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 135</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imagines (with age),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Pis. 1, 1</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">magistri equitum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv. 8,
					8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perna,</span>”
				<i>smoke-dried</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					S. 2, 2, 117</span></i>
			: Falerni, <i>kept in the smokechamber</i>
			(fumarium) <i>to ripen</i>, <i><span class="en">Tib. 2, 1,
				27</span></i>; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cadus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					5, 518</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>smelling of
			smoke</i>, <i>smoky</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">defrutum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 31, 74, § 319</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
